  "ruleText": "Sep 301.03 Application and Licensure. Fees. Application, examination, and licensing fees shall be governed by Plc 1002.49.\n\nSource. #12654, eff 10-31-18; ss by #14360, eff 10-26-25, EXPIRES: 10-26-35",
